  - tests/fixtures/krusty/
      Test inputs and expected outputs recorded by running kustomize's
      api/krusty test suite with an added recorder. Modified: converted from
      Go test code into data files. Source commit: tests/fixtures/krusty/UPSTREAM_COMMIT.
  - tests/fixtures/units/
      Table-driven unit test cases from kustomize's api/filters tests.
      Modified: converted from Go test code into JSON.
  - src/builtin_config/
      kustomize's default field-spec tables (api/internal/konfig/builtinpluginconsts).
      Modified: extracted from Go string constants into YAML files.
  - src/schema/
      Tables derived from kustomize's kyaml/openapi package and the Kubernetes
      OpenAPI schema it embeds (namespace scope of built-in kinds; field
      structure and patch strategies). Modified: extracted into a compact JSON
      form, without descriptions or validation.
  - scripts/upstream/harness.patch
      A patch to kustomize's api/testutils/kusttest test harness.
  - Rust source files whose header says they are ported from kustomize.
      Modified: translated from Go to Rust and adapted to this crate.

